# GRASS-SETTLE: the first frame after opening FIELD_Barn must not show a grass cell of another colour with a straight
# edge (FOLIAGE-PROOF 10-28, 1_field_grass lower left). p13: not textures - after a camera cut the grass buffers are
# sized by the PREVIOUS view's GPU count (+25 %) and the generator drops every instance past it (GrassGenerate), so a
# block of cells loses its green meshes until the count comes back. The reply now waits for the grass to settle.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 40
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 20
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 1_first taken right after the camera is set: left of the path the grass has the same tone as on 2_fov70; no pale block with a straight edge
Тогда editor.log has "[Grass] variety ... truncated N->cap" after the camera cut (the cause), and 1_first still shows no pale block (the reply waited for the grass)
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 70
Тогда-вид 2_fov70 FOV 70: the grass is uniform
